'''''Argentina elongata''''' is a species of fish in the family [[Argentinidae]] endemic to [[New Zealand]], at depths of between {{convert|69|and|600|m|ft|abbr=on}}.  Its length is up to {{convert|25.0|cm|in}}.  It is a species of minor importance to local [[commercial fisheries]].
[[File:Argentina decagon by Frank Edward Clarke.jpg|thumb|A. elongata by Frank Edward Clarke]] 
